# Disabled checks: modernize-use-trailing-return-type is a style the tree does not use;
# readability-magic-numbers fires on every ABI constant and record layout size, where the literal is the specification.
Checks: >
  clang-diagnostic-*,
  clang-analyzer-*,
  bugprone-*,
  modernize-*,
  readability-*,
  -modernize-use-trailing-return-type,
  -readability-magic-numbers
WarningsAsErrors: "*"
